    "name": "Game Giant",
    "steam_appid": 3631970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/91d4b7d0234db8420f8ed8352fb54b77.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a publishing company and become the biggest game publisher in the world! From the garage to a huge office, with a lot of employees. Make decisions about which games to invest in. Keep your employees happy and working, but keep an eye on your cash, as you are one bad game away from bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/8d684627296aea02114ec47954c17842.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.poster.avif?t=1749339140\" width=616 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.webm?t=1749339140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.mp4?t=1749339140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make your employees happy, design the most efficient and comfortable office. You have a large selection of items to choose from, but beware, not all items are equally effective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/ae638ea3239e326376ef03e81dda733a.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own marketing division; it is one of the most important divisions in your company. Choose how you are going to promote the games. Are you going for ads, billboards and other traditional methods, or are you going for sponsored content and free demos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/9e0f447f71a9ada54866ccd188a63b8d.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your office with employees who can complain about the sound or environment around their desk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for new game proposals; make matches you would like to play in genre and subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content for a long playtime; in-game content for more than 40 in game years</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed info about expenses, income and profit to make educated decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire new employees, but beware of their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated interest and economy, demand will depend on popularity of genre and subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize playtests and help developers steer their game to success!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/91d4b7d0234db8420f8ed8352fb54b77.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a publishing company and become the biggest game publisher in the world! From the garage to a huge office, with a lot of employees. Make decisions about which games to invest in. Keep your employees happy and working, but keep an eye on your cash, as you are one bad game away from bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/8d684627296aea02114ec47954c17842.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.poster.avif?t=1749339140\" width=616 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.webm?t=1749339140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/1c5e55e59bea9161b4addfb736e34409.mp4?t=1749339140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make your employees happy, design the most efficient and comfortable office. You have a large selection of items to choose from, but beware, not all items are equally effective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/ae638ea3239e326376ef03e81dda733a.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own marketing division; it is one of the most important divisions in your company. Choose how you are going to promote the games. Are you going for ads, billboards and other traditional methods, or are you going for sponsored content and free demos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631970/extras/9e0f447f71a9ada54866ccd188a63b8d.avif?t=1749339140\" width=615 height=104 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your office with employees who can complain about the sound or environment around their desk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for new game proposals; make matches you would like to play in genre and subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content for a long playtime; in-game content for more than 40 in game years</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed info about expenses, income and profit to make educated decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire new employees, but beware of their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated interest and economy, demand will depend on popularity of genre and subject.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize playtests and help developers steer their game to success!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the biggest game publisher! Find developers, negotiate contract and market the games. Grow your company and design your offices.",
